keting\")]\nThe first trailer for the film was released on May 29, 2024, after debuting at [CinemaCon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Association_of_Theatre_Owners \"National Association of Theatre Owners\") the month before.[[26]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moana_2#cite_note-trailer-29)[[41]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moana_2#cite_note-44) The trailer earned over 178 million views in its first 24 hours across all platforms, breaki",
